  m_text: "<size=22>- Once game begins, one of the 10 numbers player chose turns to
    Dynamite.\n- After 20 balls are drawn, if Dynamite is part of the winning numbers,
    then Dynamite \n   explodes, awarding additional 2-5 random numbers on the board.\n
    \   - Numbers of new balls from Dynamite Feature are directly created on the board\n
    \      except where the numbers from 20 balls already occupy.</size>"
